      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This glitch is not only FBT related, but also occurs whenever I press and hold the menu button on a controller for opening the quick menu while an avatar is loading.\n\nIf I disconnect VIVE trackers and press the menu button to open the Quick menu, FBT is automatically turned off and an avatar is reloaded, but if I hold the button at this time, this glitch occur.\n\nAlso, immediately after launching VRChat or immediately after moving instances, it takes time for the avatar to load, so it is easy to trigger this glitch by trying to open the action menu.\n\nNote that if this problem occurs, you can recover from the Actions menu → Expressions → Quick Actions → Reset Avatar.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
